@baseUrl = http://localhost:3333

### Task 1: Register User 1
POST {{baseUrl}}/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "John Doe",
  "email": "john@example.com",
  "password": "password123",
  "passwordConfirmation": "password123"
}

### Task 2: Login User 1 (Extracts bearer token automatically)
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/sessions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "john@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Extract Token from Login Response
@authToken = {{login.response.body.data.token}}

### Task 3: Get Authenticated User Profile
GET {{baseUrl}}/me
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Task 4a: Get All Tasks (Initially empty)
GET {{baseUrl}}/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Task 4b: Create a Task
# @name createTask
POST {{baseUrl}}/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Complete Task API",
  "description": "Implement authentication and ownership checks",
  "status": "pending"
}

### Extract Task ID from Creation Response
@taskId = {{createTask.response.body.id}}

### Task 4c: Get Single Task by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/tasks/{{taskId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Task 4d: Update Task
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/tasks/{{taskId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "in_progress"
}

### Task 5: Verify Ownership Protection (User 2 Scenario)

### 1. Register User 2
POST {{baseUrl}}/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Jane Doe",
  "email": "jane@example.com",
  "password": "password123",
  "passwordConfirmation": "password123"
}

### 2. Login User 2
# @name loginUser2
POST {{baseUrl}}/sessions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "jane@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}
###
@authTokenUser2 = {{loginUser2.response.body.data.token}}

### 3. Attempt to update User 1's task with User 2's token (Should return 403 Forbidden or 404 Not Found)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/tasks/{{taskId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authTokenUser2}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "completed"
}

### 4. Attempt to delete User 1's task with User 2's token (Should return 403 Forbidden or 404 Not Found)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/tasks/{{taskId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authTokenUser2}}

### Task 4e: Delete Task (as Task Owner)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/tasks/{{taskId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}